# Helm grants banding until end of turn, letting its controller assign a blocked creature's damage (CR 702.22j).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Emerald
Helm of Chatzuk
Ornithopter
Llanowar Elves
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Hill Giant
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Helm of Chatzuk.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Helm of Chatzuk.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Helm of Chatzuk.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = Banding
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Helm of Chatzuk.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Hill Giant > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Hill Giant; Llanowar Elves > Hill Giant)
Bot1.AssignDamage(Hill Giant > Ornithopter: 3)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Helm of Chatzuk.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Banding; Flying
